msgid "# Mooncake Layerwise Hybrid Attention"
msgstr "# Mooncake 分层混合注意力"

msgid "## Feature Introduction"
msgstr "## 特性介绍"

msgid ""
"Mooncake layerwise hybrid attention extends KV cache pooling to models with\n"
"multiple cache groups. It saves and restores each group's cache layer by layer,\n"
"so that a request can reuse a prefix together with the window, compressed cache,\n"
"or recurrent state needed to continue computation."
msgstr ""
"Mooncake 分层混合注意力将 KV "
"缓存池化扩展到具有多个缓存组的模型。它逐层保存和恢复每个组的缓存，使请求能够复用前缀以及继续计算所需的窗口、压缩缓存或循环状态。"

msgid ""
"This feature uses `AscendStoreConnector` with `backend=\"mooncake\"` and\n"
"`use_layerwise=true`. Cache groups are detected from the model's runtime cache\n"
"configuration; no separate hybrid-pooling switch is required."
msgstr ""
"此特性使用 `AscendStoreConnector`，配置 `backend=\"mooncake\"` 和 "
"`use_layerwise=true`。缓存组从模型的运行时缓存配置中自动检测；无需单独的混合池化开关。"

msgid ""
"For the basic transfer mechanism, Mooncake preparation, and common parameters,\n"
"see [Mooncake Layerwise KV Cache Pooling](mooncake_layerwise_adaptation_and_optimization.md)."
msgstr ""
"关于基本传输机制、Mooncake 准备工作和常用参数，请参见 [Mooncake 分层 KV "
"缓存池化](mooncake_layerwise_adaptation_and_optimization.md)。"

msgid "### Usage Scenarios"
msgstr "### 使用场景"

msgid ""
"- Models combining full attention and sliding-window attention.\n"
"- Models with compressed KV, indexer caches, and compressor state, such as DeepSeek-V4.\n"
"- Models combining attention with linear or recurrent layers that use aligned state checkpoints."
msgstr ""
"- 结合全注意力和滑动窗口注意力的模型。\n"
"- 具有压缩 KV、索引器缓存和压缩器状态的模型，例如 DeepSeek-V4。\n"
"- 结合注意力与线性层或循环层、并使用对齐状态检查点的模型。"

msgid "### Constraints and Limitations"
msgstr "### 约束与限制"

msgid ""
"The common Mooncake dependency and deployment requirements are listed in the\n"
"[layerwise pooling guide](mooncake_layerwise_adaptation_and_optimization.md#constraints-and-limitations)."
msgstr ""
"通用的 Mooncake "
"依赖和部署要求列在[分层池化指南](mooncake_layerwise_adaptation_and_optimization.md#constraints-"
"and-limitations)中。"

msgid "| Category | Constraint |"
msgstr "| 类别 | 约束 |"

msgid ""
"| Attention backend | Compute/transfer overlap is integrated with Ascend FA,"
" SFA, and DSA paths. Other attention backends need their own integration. |"
msgstr "| 注意力后端 | 计算/传输重叠已集成到昇腾 FA、SFA 和 DSA 路径中。其他注意力后端需要自行集成。 |"

msgid ""
"| Execution mode | Eager and graph-mode compatibility follows the selected "
"model and attention backend. |"
msgstr "| 执行模式 | Eager 和图模式的兼容性取决于所选模型和注意力后端。 |"

msgid ""
"| Recurrent state | Recurrent and linear-attention groups, including GDN and"
" KDA state, require `mamba_cache_mode=\"align\"`. |"
msgstr "| 循环状态 | 循环和线性注意力组（包括 GDN 和 KDA 状态）需要 `mamba_cache_mode=\"align\"`。 |"

msgid ""
"| Parallelism | Use matching TP, PP, PCP, and PP layer partitions on sharing"
" instances. DCP greater than `1` and TP mismatch are not supported. |"
msgstr "| 并行 | 在共享实例上使用匹配的 TP、PP、PCP 和 PP 层分区。不支持 DCP 大于 `1` 以及 TP 不匹配的情况。 |"

msgid ""
"| PP | Uneven partitions and stage-local groups are supported only when "
"every stage owns layers in every required group. Empty stage-local groups "
"are not supported. |"
msgstr "| PP | 仅当每个阶段在每个所需组中都拥有层时，才支持不均匀分区和阶段本地组。不支持空的阶段本地组。 |"

msgid ""
"| PCP | Each PCP rank stores its own snapshot. Account for these copies in "
"Store capacity and bandwidth. |"
msgstr "| PCP | 每个 PCP rank 存储自己的快照。请在 Store 容量和带宽中考虑这些副本。 |"

msgid ""
"| KVPP | Hybrid layerwise pooling does not support KVPP. Mooncake layerwise "
"PCP also cannot be combined with `enable_kvpp`. |"
msgstr "| KVPP | 混合分层池化不支持 KVPP。Mooncake 分层 PCP 也不能与 `enable_kvpp` 组合使用。 |"

msgid ""
"| Cache storage | Partial-block offloading and cross-layer cache-buffer "
"reuse are not supported. |"
msgstr "| 缓存存储 | 不支持部分块卸载和跨层缓存缓冲区复用。 |"

msgid ""
"| Load failures | Hybrid models do not support "
"`kv_load_failure_policy=recompute`. A load failure must not continue with "
"incomplete state. |"
msgstr ""
"| 加载失败 | 混合模型不支持 `kv_load_failure_policy=recompute`。加载失败时不得以不完整状态继续。 |"

msgid ""
"Model-specific quantization, graph mode, and speculative-decoding support should\n"
"be checked in the corresponding model deployment guide."
msgstr "模型特定的量化、图模式和投机解码支持应在相应的模型部署指南中查看。"

msgid "## How It Works"
msgstr "## 工作原理"

msgid "### Independent Cache Groups"
msgstr "### 独立缓存组"

msgid ""
"A hybrid model can use different block sizes and cache entries in different\n"
"groups. Mooncake stores one object per group, logical block, and storing\n"
"rank within each pipeline stage. Each object contains that group's layer data;\n"
"range transfers read or write only the entries needed by the current layer."
msgstr ""
"混合模型可以在不同组中使用不同的块大小和缓存条目。Mooncake 在每个流水线阶段内为每个组、逻辑块和存储 rank "
"存储一个对象。每个对象包含该组的层数据；范围传输仅读写当前层所需的条目。"

msgid "For example, a model may have the following layout:"
msgstr "例如，模型可能具有以下布局："

msgid ""
"| Cache group | Tokens per block | Layers with cache entries | Object "
"committed after |"
msgstr "| 缓存组 | 每块 token 数 | 具有缓存条目的层 | 对象提交时机 |"

msgid ""
"The sizes and layer numbers above are illustrative. Groups can have different\n"
"commit boundaries, and one physical layer can transfer entries from several\n"
"groups. Object identity includes the group and a cache-layout fingerprint to\n"
"separate incompatible group layouts. Different model weights still require\n"
"separate pool namespaces even when model names and cache layouts match."
msgstr ""
"上述大小和层编号仅为示例。各组可以有不同的提交边界，一个物理层可以传输来自多个组的条目。对象标识包含组和缓存布局指纹，以区分不兼容的组布局。即使模型名称和缓存布局匹配，不同的模型权重仍需要单独的池命名空间。"

msgid "### Consistent Prefix Recovery"
msgstr "### 一致的前缀恢复"

msgid ""
"Reusing a hybrid prefix requires more than finding full-attention KV. The\n"
"request must also recover the window or state checkpoint needed to continue at\n"
"the same token boundary."
msgstr "复用混合前缀不仅仅需要找到全注意力 KV。请求还必须恢复在同一 token 边界继续计算所需的窗口或状态检查点。"

msgid ""
"The cache coordinator selects the blocks required by each group and finds a\n"
"common reusable token boundary. A hit is reported only when all required\n"
"objects are committed and readable across the participating ranks and stages.\n"
"Missing window or recurrent state can therefore shorten the reusable prefix\n"
"even when full-attention KV is available."
msgstr ""
"缓存协调器选择每个组所需的块，并找到共同的可复用 token 边界。仅当所有所需对象已提交且在所有参与的 rank "
"和阶段中可读时，才报告命中。因此，即使全注意力 KV 可用，缺少窗口或循环状态也可能缩短可复用前缀。"

msgid ""
"Only complete snapshots aligned to this common boundary are published. Sparse\n"
"state checkpoints are restored according to their group-specific masks rather\n"
"than treated as a contiguous sequence of KV blocks. Later chunked-prefill steps\n"
"can restore committed data using their current local block allocations."
msgstr ""
"仅发布与该共同边界对齐的完整快照。稀疏状态检查点根据其组特定的掩码进行恢复，而不是作为连续的 KV "
"块序列处理。后续的分块预填充步骤可以使用其当前的本地块分配来恢复已提交的数据。"

msgid "### Transfer and Cache Updates"
msgstr "### 传输与缓存更新"

msgid ""
"Future-layer loads can overlap the current attention computation. Device events\n"
"ensure that transfers access cache data after the relevant updates and that\n"
"attention waits for its required loads."
msgstr "未来层的加载可以与当前注意力计算重叠。设备事件确保传输在相关更新之后访问缓存数据，并确保注意力等待其所需的加载完成。"

msgid ""
"Full and sliding-window attention can submit saves once their cache updates are\n"
"ready at attention entry. Recurrent layers update their state during computation,\n"
"so their saves start after those updates finish. Each group commits independently\n"
"after its last participating layer. Failed writes do not publish incomplete\n"
"objects, and failed reads stop computation before incomplete hybrid state is used."
msgstr ""
"全注意力和滑动窗口注意力在注意力入口处缓存更新就绪后即可提交保存。循环层在计算过程中更新其状态，因此其保存在这些更新完成后才开始。每个组在其最后一个参与层之后独立提交。失败的写入不会发布不完整的对象，失败的读取会在使用不完整混合状态之前停止计算。"

msgid "## Usage"
msgstr "## 使用方法"

msgid "### Configure Prefill and Decode Nodes"
msgstr "### 配置 Prefill 和 Decode 节点"

msgid ""
"Prepare the Mooncake Store and client as described in the\n"
"[layerwise pooling guide](mooncake_layerwise_adaptation_and_optimization.md#prepare-mooncake),\n"
"then follow the **PD Disaggregation Scenario** in the\n"
"[Mooncake deployment guide](kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#scenario-1-mooncake-backend).\n"
"Use these Store connector configurations for hybrid models."
msgstr ""
"按照[分层池化指南](mooncake_layerwise_adaptation_and_optimization.md#prepare-"
"mooncake)中的说明准备 Mooncake Store 和客户端，然后按照 [Mooncake "
"部署指南](kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#scenario-1-mooncake-backend)中的 **PD "
"分离场景**进行操作。对混合模型使用以下 Store 连接器配置。"

msgid "**Prefill (P) node:**"
msgstr "**Prefill (P) 节点：**"

msgid "**Decode (D) node:**"
msgstr "**Decode (D) 节点：**"

msgid ""
"Hybrid models require `fail`; `recompute` is not supported. When using\n"
"`MultiConnector`, set this policy on the top-level `kv-transfer-config` and\n"
"update its `AscendStoreConnector` entry with the role and extra configuration\n"
"shown above. Decode pool access is disabled by default; enable\n"
"`consumer_is_to_load` explicitly if Decode needs to load from the pool. See\n"
"[Configure Prefill and Decode Nodes](mooncake_layerwise_adaptation_and_optimization.md#configure-prefill-and-decode-nodes)\n"
"for role behavior and IPC identifier requirements."
msgstr ""
"混合模型要求使用 `fail`；不支持 `recompute`。使用\n"
"`MultiConnector` 时，请在顶层 `kv-transfer-config` 上设置此策略，并使用上文所示的角色和额外配置\n"
"更新其 `AscendStoreConnector` 条目。Decode 池访问默认处于禁用状态；如果 Decode 需要从池中加载，\n"
"请显式启用 `consumer_is_to_load`。有关角色行为和 IPC 标识符要求，\n"
"请参阅[配置 Prefill 和 Decode 节点](mooncake_layerwise_adaptation_and_optimization.md#configure-prefill-and-decode-nodes)。"

msgid ""
"Choose model, parallelism, token-budget, and execution-mode options according\n"
"to the model deployment guide. For recurrent or linear-attention state,\n"
"set `--mamba-cache-mode align` unless the model configuration already selects it.\n"
"Use the same model weights and cache configuration on all sharing instances."
msgstr ""
"请根据模型部署指南选择模型、并行度、token 预算和执行模式选项。对于循环状态或线性注意力状态，\n"
"请设置 `--mamba-cache-mode align`，除非模型配置已选择该项。\n"
"在所有共享实例上使用相同的模型权重和缓存配置。"

msgid ""
"Inference requests use the normal OpenAI-compatible API. To exercise remote\n"
"reuse, send a long shared prefix to two instances connected to the same pool,\n"
"as described in [Use Cached Prefixes](mooncake_layerwise_adaptation_and_optimization.md#use-cached-prefixes).\n"
"Reuse advances only to a boundary where all required cache groups are available."
msgstr ""
"推理请求使用常规的 OpenAI 兼容 API。要验证远程复用，请向连接到同一池的两个实例发送较长的共享前缀，\n"
"具体方法如[使用缓存前缀](mooncake_layerwise_adaptation_and_optimization.md#use-cached-prefixes)所述。\n"
"复用只会推进到所有必需缓存组均可用的边界。"

msgid "### Prefill Context Parallelism (PCP)"
msgstr "### Prefill 上下文并行（PCP）"

msgid "To use PCP, add these options to the model's launch command:"
msgstr "要使用 PCP，请将以下选项添加到模型的启动命令中："

msgid ""
"Use the same TP, PP, and PCP topology on every instance sharing these objects.\n"
"Select Model Runner V2 for the DeepSeek-V4-Flash PCP path:"
msgstr ""
"在每个共享这些对象的实例上使用相同的 TP、PP 和 PCP 拓扑。\n"
"为 DeepSeek-V4-Flash PCP 路径选择 Model Runner V2："

msgid ""
"Each PCP worker owns separate Store objects and transfer sessions. Prefix lookup\n"
"requires committed objects from every required PCP rank, PP stage, and storing\n"
"TP rank or head. Objects from different PCP sizes are isolated, and PCP does\n"
"not change the logical token coverage of a group block."
msgstr ""
"每个 PCP worker 拥有独立的 Store 对象和传输会话。前缀查找\n"
"要求每个必需的 PCP rank、PP stage 以及存储\n"
"TP rank 或 head 都已提交对象。来自不同 PCP 大小的对象相互隔离，并且 PCP\n"
"不会改变组块的逻辑 token 覆盖范围。"

msgid ""
"PCP keeps a separate cache copy per PCP rank, so increasing PCP can increase\n"
"Store capacity and transfer-bandwidth requirements. Keep `enable_kvpp` disabled."
msgstr ""
"PCP 会为每个 PCP rank 保留单独的缓存副本，因此增加 PCP 可能会增加\n"
"Store 容量和传输带宽需求。请保持 `enable_kvpp` 处于禁用状态。"

msgid "## Configuration Parameters"
msgstr "## 配置参数"

msgid ""
"Hybrid pooling uses the same connector parameters as\n"
"[layerwise pooling](mooncake_layerwise_adaptation_and_optimization.md#configuration-parameters).\n"
"Cache-group membership, block sizes, and transfer offsets are derived from the\n"
"model's cache configuration."
msgstr ""
"混合池化使用与\n"
"[分层池化](mooncake_layerwise_adaptation_and_optimization.md#configuration-parameters)相同的连接器参数。\n"
"缓存组成员关系、块大小和传输偏移量均从\n"
"模型的缓存配置中推导得出。"

msgid "| Parameter | Requirement |"
msgstr "| 参数 | 要求 |"

msgid "| `kv_connector_extra_config.backend` | Set to `\"mooncake\"`. |"
msgstr "| `kv_connector_extra_config.backend` | 设置为 `\"mooncake\"`。 |"

msgid "| `kv_connector_extra_config.use_layerwise` | Set to `true`. |"
msgstr "| `kv_connector_extra_config.use_layerwise` | 设置为 `true`。 |"

msgid ""
"| `kv_connector_extra_config.layerwise_prefetch_layers` | Positive integer, "
"default `2`; controls future-layer load distance. |"
msgstr ""
"| `kv_connector_extra_config.layerwise_prefetch_layers` | 正整数，默认值为 "
"`2`；控制未来层的加载距离。 |"

msgid ""
"| `mamba_cache_mode` | Use `\"align\"` for models with recurrent-state "
"groups. |"
msgstr "| `mamba_cache_mode` | 对于具有循环状态组的模型，使用 `\"align\"`。 |"

msgid "| `decode_context_parallel_size` | Keep at `1`. |"
msgstr "| `decode_context_parallel_size` | 保持为 `1`。 |"

msgid ""
"| `prefill_context_parallel_size` | Default `1`; sharing instances must use "
"the same value. |"
msgstr "| `prefill_context_parallel_size` | 默认值为 `1`；共享实例必须使用相同的值。 |"

msgid "## Tuning Suggestions"
msgstr "## 调优建议"

msgid ""
"- Start with a prefetch distance of `2` and adjust it to the model's attention\n"
"  time and transfer bandwidth. A larger distance can hide loads but can also\n"
"  increase contention with HCCL or expert-parallel communication.\n"
"- Size the Store for all cache groups and PCP copies, including indexer and\n"
"  recurrent state. Full-attention KV size alone is insufficient for capacity planning.\n"
"- Use representative prompt lengths and shared prefixes when measuring reuse.\n"
"  Different group block sizes and checkpoint boundaries determine how much of\n"
"  a prefix can be restored."
msgstr ""
"- 从预取距离 `2` 开始，并根据模型的注意力\n"
"  时间和传输带宽进行调整。较大的距离可以隐藏加载，但也可能\n"
"  增加与 HCCL 或专家并行通信的争用。\n"
"- 为所有缓存组和 PCP 副本规划 Store 容量，包括 indexer 和\n"
"  循环状态。仅凭全注意力 KV 大小不足以进行容量规划。\n"
"- 在测量复用时使用具有代表性的提示长度和共享前缀。\n"
"  不同的组块大小和检查点边界决定了前缀\n"
"  可以恢复多少。"
